Type: Package
Package: MeshUtils
Title: Utility Functions for 3D Meshes Based on 'CGAL'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
  c(person("Daniel", "Wollschlaeger", role=c("aut", "cre"), email="wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de"),
    person("Stephane", "Laurent", role=c("aut")))
Maintainer: Daniel Wollschlaeger <wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de>
Description: An adaptation of code from packages 'Boov', 'PolygonSoup',
    and 'cgalMeshes' developed by Stéphane Laurent. Uses the 'C++'
    library 'CGAL' <https://www.cgal.org/>. Supports basic processing
    of 3D meshes as well as mesh repair, remeshing, Boolean operations
    (union, difference and intersection), surface reconstruction,
    (optimal) bounding box, and Hausdorff distance.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/dwoll/MeshUtils/
BugReports: https://github.com/dwoll/MeshUtils/issues/
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.9),
    rgl,
    Rvcg
LinkingTo:
    BH,
    Rcpp,
    RcppCGAL,
    RcppEigen
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
SystemRequirements: C++ 17, gmp, mpfr
Roxygen: list(markdown=TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
